why is the score not resetting if the player dies?

response:
The issue with your code is that you're only saving and loading the `SCORE` variable when it changes due to adding or subtracting points from the game. However, if the player dies (i.e., loses all their lives), the `SCORE` variable will still be incremented each time they gain a new life, but it won't be saved because there's no change in the value.

To fix this, you need to reset the `SCORE` variable whenever the player dies. One way to do this is to add a boolean flag called `IsGameOver` which is initially set to false. When the player dies, you can toggle this flag to true, and then reset the `SCORE` variable to its initial value (which should be 0).

Here's an updated version of your code:

```csharp
using System.Collections;
using System.Collections.Generic;
using UnityEngine;
using UnityEngine.UI; // This line enables use of uGUI classes like Text.

public class ScoreCounter : MonoBehaviour
{
    [Header("Static")]
    public static int SCORE { get; set; } = 0;

    private Text uiText;
    private bool IsGameOver = false;

    private void Start()
    {
        uiText = GetComponent<Text>();
        LoadScore();
    }

    private void Update()
    {
        uiText.text = SCORE.ToString("Score:#,0");
    }

    public void AddScore(int scoreAmount)
    {
        SCORE += scoreAmount;
        SaveScore();
    }

    private void SaveScore()
    {
        PlayerPrefs.SetInt("Score", SCORE);
    }

    private void LoadScore()
    {
        SCORE = PlayerPrefs.GetInt("Score", 0);
    }

    public void Die()
    {
        IsGameOver = true;
        ResetScore();
    }

    private void ResetScore()
    {
        SCORE = 0;
        SaveScore();
    }
}
```

In this updated code, I've added a `Die()` method that sets the `IsGameOver` flag to true and calls the `ResetScore()` method. The `ResetScore()` method simply resets the `SCORE` variable to 0 and saves it again using `SaveScore()`. This ensures that the `SCORE` variable is reset every time the player dies, so the player starts fresh after dying.
